  "text": "The scheme includes a unique emergency spillway beneath Bell’s Hill slip to address landslide-induced blockage risks, a 15% increase in floodwater conveyance capacity, and a funding model that distributes costs 70% regionally and 30% locally. It employs drone-assisted surveying for asset management and aligns with Northland Regional Council's long-term infrastructure plans.",
